'''Tank''' is a dungeon [[class]] that specializes in {{Stat|Effective Health}} and being able to take large amount of damage and keeping [[mobs]] off their teammates.

== Class Passives ==
* Base {{Stat|health|+100}}, {{Stat|defense|+50}}, and {{Stat|Vitality|+10}}
* {{AN|Protective Barrier}}: Gain permanent {{Green|+25%}} (Multiplicative) {{stat|def}}. Upon falling below {{Stat|hp|50%}}, gain an {{Stat|Absorption}} Shield {{Red|10%}} of your {{Stat|hp}}. Cooldown: 90s
* {{AN|Taunt}}: Increases the chance for mobs to target you when you are above {{Stat|hp|25%|short=y}}.
* {{AN|Diversion}}: Divert 80% of the damage taken by your teammates within 30 blocks around you.
* {{AN|Defensive Stance}}: Grants immunity to knockback from mobs.

== Dungeon Orb Abilities ==
* {{AN|Seismic Wave}}: A Seismic Wave emerges from underneath you and travels in a straight line. Deals 20000 + 10% every {{stat|def|50}} in damage to any enemy in its path. Cooldown: 15s
* {{AN|Castle of Stone}}: Fortifies your {{Stat|def}} by giving a 70% damage reduction for 20 seconds. Also aggros all enemies in a 10 block radius. Cooldown: 150s

== Ghost Abilities ==
* {{AN|Stun Potion}}: Throw a potion which temporarily stuns all monsters in a 10 block radius.
* {{AN|Absorption Potion}}: Throw a potion which gives all teammates in a 10 block radius {{stat|absorption|+200}} for 3 seconds.

== Leveling Rewards ==
{{/Skill UI}}

You can level up the tank class while playing as a tank or if you have a teammate that is tank, you get some tank XP as a team bonus.

For every tank level up to level 49 you get: 
* {{Stat|def|+1}}
* {{Stat|vit|+0.1}}
* {{Stat|def|0.2%}}
*+ 20000-50000 Seismic Wave Damage
*{{Stat|absorb|+10}} from Ghost Absorption Potion

At Tank Level 50, you instead gain {{Stat|Defense|+2}}, {{Stat|Vitality|+0.2}}, along with {{Stat|def|+0.2%}}, {{Stat|absorb|+10}} from Ghost {{Stat|absorb}} Potion, and +100000 Seismic Wave Damage

At Tank Level 50, you receive the following total buffs:

* {{Stat|def|+51}}, for a total of {{Stat|def|+101}}
* {{Stat|vit|+5.1}}, for a total of {{Stat|vit|+15.1}}
* {{stat|def|+10%}} for a total of permanent {{stat|def|+35%}} (Multiplicative)
* {{Stat|absorb|+500}} from Ghost {{Stat|absorb}} Potion, for a total of {{Stat|absorb|700}}

When you are the only tank, the buffs change as following:

* {{Green|+25%}} -> {{Green|+50%}} (Multiplicative) permanent {{stat|def}}
* Upon Falling below {{Stat|hp|50% -> 100%}}, gain an {{Stat|absorb}} Shield {{Red|10% -> 20%}} of your {{Stat|hp}}. Note: As the health at which this activates gets increased to 100%, it will always trigger every 90s -> 45s. It is unknown if this is intended or not.

== Milestones ==
{{Main|Class Milestones}}
Tank class can reach its milestones by tanking and dealing damage in the dungeon. Refer [[Class Milestones#Catacombs|here]] for a table showcasing class milestones. 

== Trivia ==
* The {{AN|Castle of Stone}} perk is a reference to the guardian skill ''Castle of Stone'' from Log Horizon, of which grants one immunity to damage for a short duration. The perk itself does more resemble the guardian skill ''Anchor Howl'', of which aggros enemies and grants one increased defense for a short duration.
* There is a glitch where, when changing your armor set via the Wardrobe, the Tank {{Stat|Knockback}} immunity perk stops working.
* There is another glitch where, if mobs are standing on carpet, the mobs on carpet will not take any damage from the Seismic Wave ability. Noticeable when you are soloing the [[The Catacombs - Floor VI|Floor VI]] boss fight.

